WEBVTT

00:00:00.102 --> 00:00:05.252
This is the final step for Module 5 The page keeps
track

00:00:05.264 --> 00:00:10.601
of your knowledge checks and coding exercises Before
completing the module review

00:00:10.627 --> 00:00:15.060
your progress and make sure you have attempted the
required activities When

00:00:15.073 --> 00:00:19.660
you select Complete Module the page generates an
Assignment 5 submission report

00:00:20.575 --> 00:00:23.745
You can copy that report and paste it into the
Canvas Assignment

00:00:23.771 --> 00:00:28.513
5 text-entry box Remember that the progress on this
page is stored

00:00:28.539 --> 00:00:32.714
locally in your current browser and on this device
It is not

00:00:32.740 --> 00:00:38.243
automatically sent to Canvas If you completed some
SQL in pgAdmin make

00:00:38.269 --> 00:00:41.117
sure the final required answers are also entered and
checked in the

00:00:41.129 --> 00:00:46.142
browser so they are included in your module progress
Review anything incomplete

00:00:46.155 --> 00:00:48.539
before creating your final submission report
